            <h3>Search PC</h3>
            <p>Find installed apps, files, folders and documents on the computer. Search PC can also open common Windows tools by their normal names.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>LexDesk Start</h3>
            <p>Reach Apps, Maintenance, Windows Tools, Start with Windows and Back to Windows from one clear menu instead of hunting through the operating system.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>PC maintenance</h3>
            <p>Check virus protection, Windows Update, free storage and restart status, with guided Windows repair and cleanup tools when they are actually useful.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Apps over Web Pages</h3>
            <p>LexDesk can place ordinary Windows apps over Web Pages so the LexDesk top and bottom bars remain available while you work.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Firewall &amp; safer setup</h3>
            <p>Use plain-English Windows Firewall controls, including recommended protection and a stricter Public Wi-Fi option, without learning firewall rules.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>OneDrive safety guide</h3>
            <p>A deliberately cautious workflow checks for cloud-only files, creates a verified external copy and asks you to confirm that backup before folder locations can be changed.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Calendar reminders</h3>
            <p>Save calendar events with reminder timing and optional links. LexDesk can show an in-app reminder while you are working and use Windows notifications when available.</p>
          </article>
